Below are reference tasks from the same benchmark, grouped and each tagged with whether {forecasted_model} actually solved it. Each group reports an empirical pass rate for {forecasted_model} on similar tasks — this is your single most important piece of evidence.

{capability_profile}

Target task:
{target_task_text}

Estimate the probability that {forecasted_model} solves the target task on a single attempt.

Follow this disciplined procedure:

