Sort the target into one of these types and commit accordingly:

 • ROUTINE / KNOWLEDGE tasks: single bash command, MCQ, "run strings", fix a syntax error, read a config, a single tool invocation, or reading provided high-level source. Capable models usually solve these. Predict HIGH — but see STEP 3.5 before going above 0.90.

