The 0.40-0.70 range is costly when you are actually sure. If evidence points clearly one way, commit: format-robust routine with solved analogues → 0.92-0.97; failed-analogue exploitation → 0.15-0.30. But do NOT force a format-risky task up to an extreme just to avoid the middle — an exact-string task with real ambiguity genuinely belongs around 0.60-0.80.

